              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "Jzz1943"
            },
            "body": "@michaelzhang-ai Thanks for catching this and providing the CI evidence. I checked the NIXL code: device_list overrides NET_DEVICES, dropping the configured loopback interface. Simply adding lo to device_list would not work because NIXL appends :1. I’ll investigate a follow-up fix to preserve explicit UCX configuration while retaining per-GPU selection where supported. Could you help validate it on the affected AMD runners?\r\n\r\n",
